# Black Lotus adds "three mana of any one color" (CR 106.1b): {B}{B}{B}, never {U}{B} and another. With only the Lotus and
# Mox Pearl untapped, Bot1 can't pay Raffine, Scheming Seer's {W}{U}{B}, so it is not offered (CR 601.2g-h). With Mox
# Sapphire too it is, and the Lotus's black pays the {B}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Raffine, Scheming Seer
Mox Sapphire
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

